   "ruling": "Ruling: representation; i4562 p. 10. The reply reads rprop.short_class for every building, where the project asks it only of nonresidential property (rprop.short_class_if_nonres: a residential building is neither a farm building nor a motor fuels outlet), and computes personal property on a 5-year half-year basis, which the project refuses (rprop.personal; i4562 p. 9, Lines 19a Through 19j). The only differences are candidate-unknown on returns that do not answer rprop.short_class (17 completed, 3 incomplete, 2 refused); no completed value differs (executable triage .transcription/triage/2025/rprop.json: 104 of 126 agree). Project stands.",
